{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"154a3728694480f8a7d2bcf5b4ba0e013ef30af0e46392cac7149fcbe6a97d4d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華譴責以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人哪，當聽耶和華的話！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要起來向山嶺爭辯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使岡陵聽你的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"山嶺和地永久的根基啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽耶和華爭辯的話！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華要與他的百姓爭辯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與以色列爭論。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"我的百姓啊，我向你做了甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在甚麼事上使你厭煩？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你可以對我證明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾將你從埃及地領出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從作奴僕之家救贖你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也差遣摩西、亞倫，和米利暗在你前面行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，你們當追念摩押王巴勒所設的謀","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和比珥的兒子巴蘭回答他的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並你們從什亭到吉甲所遇見的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好使你們知道耶和華公義的作為。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的要求"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我朝見耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在至高上帝面前跪拜，當獻上甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈可獻一歲的牛犢為燔祭嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華豈喜悅千千的公羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或是萬萬的油河嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈可為自己的罪過獻我的長子嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為心中的罪惡獻我身所生的嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人哪，耶和華已指示你何為善。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他向你所要的是甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只要你行公義，好憐憫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"存謙卑的心，與你的上帝同行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華向這城呼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧人必敬畏他的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們當聽是誰派定刑杖的懲罰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人家中不仍有非義之財","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和可惡的小升斗嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若用不公道的天平和囊中詭詐的法碼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈可算為清潔呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城裏的富戶滿行強暴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的居民也說謊言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"口中的舌頭是詭詐的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我擊打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的傷痕甚重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你因你的罪惡荒涼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要吃，卻吃不飽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的虛弱必顯在你中間。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必挪去，卻不得救護；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所救護的，我必交給刀劍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必撒種，卻不得收割；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹橄欖，卻不得油抹身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"踹葡萄，卻不得酒喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你守暗利的惡規，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行亞哈家一切所行的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"順從他們的計謀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我必使你荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你的居民令人嗤笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們也必擔當我民的羞辱。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MIC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MIC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/MIC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}